{"result":"{
  "id": "18750",
  "key": "SFCC-404",
  "summary": "Cart Message Component - PWA Kit",
  "description": "**As a** Developer, I want to build the cart page-level notification banner as a reusable PWA Kit component, so that contextual error, warning, and success messages can be displayed consistently at the top of the cart drawer across all cart states.\n\nThis is a **PWA Kit component story** covering the build, variants, accessibility, and responsive behaviour of the page-level notification banner. The banner appears at the top of the cart drawer and is triggered programmatically by cart logic.\n\n**All banner copy is driven by Contentful** — a UI Copy content model in Contentful which has been built to support success states, labels, and error states. Nothing is hardcoded in the PWA Kit component. Copy can be updated by Zimmermann in Contentful without a code deployment. Note: this story does not assume final copy — all content examples referenced in the ACs are indicative only and are configurable.\n\nThe banner has three states:\n\n1. **Error** — red X icon, red text. Triggered by: fully OOS item (SFCC-282), limited stock (SFCC-282), product unavailable (SFCC-796), invalid promo code (SFCC-191). Current content examples: \"AN ITEM IN YOUR BAG IS UNAVAILABLE\", \"AN ITEM IN YOUR BAG HAS LIMITED STOCK\"\n1. **Warning** — grey info icon, grey text. Triggered by: maximum quantity reached (SFCC-250). Current content example: \"AN ITEM IN YOUR BAG HAS REACHED MAXIMUM QUANTITY\"\n1. **Success** — triggered by: item moved to wishlist (SFCC-272), promotion code has been added (SFCC-191). Current content example: \"Product Name has been moved to your wishlist\" “Promotion code added”\n\nEach state shares the same component structure but differs in icon and text colour. The specific copy for each trigger is configurable via the Contentful UI Copy content model.\n\n*UI Design Kit:* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40003189-103431&t=ZvCo9gz88s0cUoFT-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\n*Designs:* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40000257-6983&p=f&t=ZvCo9gz88s0cUoFT-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\n*Error:*\n\n![\"image-20260826-073703.png\"](image-20260826-073703.png)\n\n\n\n*Warning:*\n\n![\"image-20260826-073727.png\"](image-20260826-073727.png)\n\n\n\n*Success:*\n\n![\"image-20260826-073815.png\"](image-20260826-073815.png)",
