      "body": "Hi User:600810992b411b0076aaf4cc User:623a4c25562ab90069f7e510 \n\nAs error and warning messages are all caps, should success be the same?\n\nI know this ticket only covers the cart message component but when a there is an error message displayed how will a screen reader behave. Will it read out all error messages on the page (cart message, item message and order summary)?",
