      "body": "Hi User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 \n\nAll error and warning messages should be in lower case - designs have been updated.\n\nFor example: [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40000257-6983&p=f&t=XzHOI7MA1PM9TsUu-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026) \n\n![\"image-20260901-044146.png\"](image-20260901-044146.png)\n\nRe accessibility, the screen reader wouldn’t read out all three. There are some rules that need to be defined in the codebase to give the screenreader appropriate text to read. I’ve created a placeholder story so we can proceed without blocking this one.\n\n[SFCC-867](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-867)",
